  "body_html": "\u003cp\u003eHey everyone! 🎉\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fqxi3xotj34zup7ex9lbz.gif\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fqxi3xotj34zup7ex9lbz.gif\" alt=\"Image descripution\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"333\" height=\"334\" data-animated=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\u003chr\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F8r2f5btydkc540gvb1vk.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F8r2f5btydkc540gvb1vk.png\" alt=\"Image descrihption\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"720\" height=\"1257\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eI have some exciting news to share!\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eI created my \u003cstrong\u003efirst GitHub Issue\u003c/strong\u003e and my \u003cstrong\u003efirst Forem (DEV.to) Issue\u003c/strong\u003e. And honestly, I am super excited about it!\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"ltag_github-liquid-tag\"\u003e\n  \u003ch1\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/forem/forem/issues/24805\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg class=\"github-logo\" alt=\"GitHub logo\" src=\"https://assets.dev.to/assets/github-logo-5a155e1f9a670af7944dd5e12375bc76ed542ea80224905ecaf878b9157cdefc.svg\"\u003e\n      \u003cspan class=\"issue-title\"\u003e\n        When we embed a comment on DEV finding that particular comment within the entire post can be difficult\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003cspan class=\"issue-number\"\u003e#24805\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/h1\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"github-thread\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"timeline-comment-header\"\u003e\n      \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/stargshs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\n        \u003cimg class=\"github-liquid-tag-img\" src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F351585625%3Fv%3D4\" alt=\"stargshs avatar\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\n      \u003c/a\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"timeline-comment-header-text\"\u003e\n        \u003cstrong\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/stargshs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003estargshs\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/strong\u003e posted on \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/forem/forem/issues/24805\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2026-11-17T12:11:46Z\"\u003eNov 17, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"ltag-github-body\"\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003eWhen we embed a comment on DEV Community, we can find the original post, but finding that particular comment within the entire post can be difficult, especially when there are many comments. It would be helpful if the embedded comment included a direct link or an option to jump straight to that specific comment in the original discussion. This would save time and make it much easier for readers to find the exact comment and its context.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58e19a39-14da-4a3d-9c15-4a953ffcf474\"\u003e\u003cimg width=\"716\" height=\"531\" alt=\"Screenshot_2026-11-17-17-31-12-31\" src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fuser-attachments%2Fassets%2F58e19a39-14da-4a3d-9c15-4a953ffcf474\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 531px;\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"gh-btn-container\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"gh-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/forem/forem/issues/24805\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eView on GitHub\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003cp\u003eIt was a new experience for me. I learned how to create issues, explain things, and communicate with the community.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eA big thank you to \u003cstrong\u003eFrancis Sir\u003c/strong\u003e for helping and guiding me. Your support really means a lot! ❤️\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAnd also \u003ca class=\"mentioned-user\" href=\"https://dev.to/dj29\"\u003e@dj29\u003c/a\u003e bro❤️\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eI am still learning, exploring, and improving my skills. Every new experience gives me a chance to learn something different.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eMy first issues are done, and I am looking forward to many more contributions!\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"crayons-card c-embed text-styles text-styles--secondary\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"c-embed__content\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"c-embed__cover\"\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/stargshs\" class=\"c-link align-middle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F351585625%3Fv%3D4%3Fs%3D400\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"m-0\" width=\"460\"\u003e\n          \u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"c-embed__body\"\u003e\n        \u003ch2 class=\"fs-xl lh-tight\"\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/stargshs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"c-link\"\u003e\n            stargshs (STAR) · GitHub\n          \u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/h2\u003e\n          \u003cp class=\"truncate-at-3\"\u003e\n            This star shines brightly✨. stargshs has one repository available. Follow their code on GitHub.\n          \u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"color-secondary fs-s flex items-center\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg alt=\"favicon\" class=\"c-embed__favicon m-0 mr-2 radius-0\" src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.githubassets.com%2Ffavicons%2Ffavicon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"\u003e\n          github.com\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmall steps, big dreams. This is just the beginning!\u003c/strong\u003e ⭐🚀\u003c/p\u003e\n\n",
  "body_markdown": "\n\nHey everyone! 🎉\n\n\n\n![Image descripution](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/qxi3xotj34zup7ex9lbz.gif)\n\n____\n\n![Image descrihption](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/8r2f5btydkc540gvb1vk.png)\n\nI have some exciting news to share!\n\nI created my **first GitHub Issue** and my **first Forem (DEV.to) Issue**. And honestly, I am super excited about it!\n\n\n{% embed https://github.com/forem/forem/issues/24805 %}\n\n\nIt was a new experience for me. I learned how to create issues, explain things, and communicate with the community.\n\nA big thank you to **Francis Sir** for helping and guiding me. Your support really means a lot! ❤️\n\nAnd also @dj29 bro❤️\n\nI am still learning, exploring, and improving my skills. Every new experience gives me a chance to learn something different.\n\nMy first issues are done, and I am looking forward to many more contributions!\n\n{% embed https://github.com/stargshs %}\n\n\n\n**Small steps, big dreams. This is just the beginning!** ⭐🚀",
